@startgantt
<style>
ganttDiagram {
  task {
    BackGroundColor lightblue
    LineColor darkblue
  }
  milestone {
    BackGroundColor gold
    LineColor darkorange
    FontColor white
    FontStyle bold
  }
}
</style>

title Wandering Party - Desarrollo del City Builder Steampunk
printscale weekly
saturday are closed
sunday are closed

' Colores por categoría
!define PREPRODUCCION #E74C3C
!define PRODUCCION #3498DB
!define POSTPRODUCCION #16A085
!define ARTE #9B59B6
!define AUDIO #F39C12

-- Fase 1 - Preproducción --
[Concepto y Diseño] as [CONCEPT] lasts 14 days and is colored in PREPRODUCCION
[CONCEPT] is 100% complete
note bottom
  Equipo: Game Designer, Narrative Designer
end note

[Prototipo de Mecánicas Core] as [PROTO_MECH] lasts 21 days and is colored in PREPRODUCCION
[PROTO_MECH] starts at [CONCEPT]'s end
[PROTO_MECH] is 100% complete
note bottom
  Equipo: Gameplay Programmer
  Recursos: Unity/Godot, test builds
end note

[Arte Conceptual] as [CONCEPT_ART] lasts 28 days and starts at [CONCEPT]'s end and is colored in ARTE
[CONCEPT_ART] is 100% complete
note bottom
  Equipo: Concept Artist, 3D Artist
  Recursos: Blender, Photoshop
end note

[Milestone 1: Prototipo] as [M1] happens at [PROTO_MECH]'s end

-- Fase 2 - Producción --
[Modelado 3D Edificios] as [MODEL_BUILD] lasts 35 days and starts at [M1]'s end and is colored in ARTE
[MODEL_BUILD] is 80% complete
note bottom
  Equipo: 3D Artists
  Recursos: Blender, Substance Painter
end note

[Modelado Personajes] as [MODEL_CHAR] lasts 28 days and starts at [MODEL_BUILD]'s start and is colored in ARTE
[MODEL_CHAR] is 75% complete

[Sistema de Construcción] as [SYS_BUILD] lasts 21 days and starts at [M1]'s end and is colored in PRODUCCION
[SYS_BUILD] is 70% complete
note bottom
  Equipo: Gameplay Programmer
  Recursos: Grid system, placement tools
end note

[Sistema de Recursos] as [SYS_RESOURCE] lasts 21 days and starts at [SYS_BUILD]'s start and is colored in PRODUCCION
[SYS_RESOURCE] is 65% complete

[IA] as [AI_POP] lasts 28 days and starts at [SYS_RESOURCE]'s end and is colored in PRODUCCION
[AI_POP] is 50% complete
note bottom
  Equipo: AI Programmer
end note

[Sistema de Eventos] as [SYS_EVENTS] lasts 21 days and starts at [AI_POP]'s start and is colored in PRODUCCION
[SYS_EVENTS] is 45% complete

[UI/UX] as [UI] lasts 35 days and starts at [SYS_BUILD]'s end and is colored in ARTE
[UI] is 60% complete
note bottom
  Equipo: UI/UX Designer
  Recursos: Figma
end note

[Música y SFX] as [AUDIO] lasts 42 days and starts at [MODEL_BUILD]'s start and is colored in AUDIO
[AUDIO] is 40% complete
note bottom
  Equipo: Compositor, Sound Designer
  Recursos: FL Studio, biblioteca SFX
end note

[Milestone 2: Beta] as [M2] happens at [AI_POP]'s end

-- Fase 3 - Postproducción --
[Testing y Balance] as [TESTING] lasts 28 days and starts at [M2]'s end and is colored in POSTPRODUCCION
[TESTING] is 30% complete
note bottom
  Equipo: QA Testers, Game Designer}
end note

[Optimización] as [OPTIM] lasts 21 days and starts at [TESTING]'s start and is colored in POSTPRODUCCION
[OPTIM] is 20% complete

[Pulido Final] as [POLISH] lasts 14 days and starts at [TESTING]'s end and is colored in POSTPRODUCCION
[POLISH] is 10% complete

[Marketing y Trailer] as [MARKET] lasts 21 days and starts at [POLISH]'s start and is colored in POSTPRODUCCION
[MARKET] is 5% complete
note bottom
  Equipo: Marketing, Video Editor
  Recursos: Steam page, redes sociales
end note

[Milestone 3: v1.0] as [M3] happens at [POLISH]'s end

-- Hitos --

@endgantt